{"title": "Hampo stereo module", "parts": {"lead": "<p class=lead>Stereo fisheye colour module from Dongguan Hampo Electronic Technology (翰普), with an IMU at about 500 Hz. One recording, solved as stereo and as cam0 alone.</p><div class=chips><span class=chip>Stereo</span><span class=chip>Colour</span><span class=chip>505 Hz IMU</span><span class=chip>Data not hosted</span></div><div class=vtabs role=group aria-label=\"Choose a run\"><button type=button data-vt=\"0\" aria-pressed=\"true\">Stereo + IMU</button><button type=button data-vt=\"1\" aria-pressed=\"false\">cam0 + IMU</button></div>", "glance": "<div class=band><div class=\"demo empty\"><b>No video on this page.</b> The values below come from the solved run.</div><div class=v data-v=\"0\"><div class=tiles><div><span>Reprojection median</span><b>0.28<small> px</small></b></div><div><span>cam0–cam1 baseline</span><b>65.3<small> mm</small></b></div><div><span>cam0 td</span><b>−4.74<small> ms</small></b></div><div><span>cam0 lever arm</span><b>34.5<small> mm</small></b></div></div></div><div class=v data-v=\"1\" hidden><div class=tiles><div><span>Reprojection median</span><b>0.26<small> px</small></b></div><div><span>cam0–cam1 baseline</span><b>–</b></div><div><span>cam0 td</span><b>−4.74<small> ms</small></b></div><div><span>cam0 lever arm</span><b>34.8<small> mm</small></b></div></div></div></div>", "process": "<p>The solved path of the rig around the board. Press Play or drag the bar to follow the calibration. Camera images are left out to keep the page small.</p><div class=v data-v=\"0\"><div class=procplot id=\"proc0\"></div><div class=\"mvis-progress\" data-plot=\"proc0\"><button type=button>▶ Play</button><select class=\"mvis-progress-cam\" aria-label=\"Camera shown\"><option value=\"0\">cam0</option><option value=\"1\">cam1</option></select><input type=range min=0 max=599 value=599 step=1 aria-label=\"Calibration progress\"><span class=\"mvis-progress-label\">Loading</span></div></div><div class=v data-v=\"1\" hidden><div class=procplot id=\"proc1\"></div><div class=\"mvis-progress\" data-plot=\"proc1\"><button type=button>▶ Play</button><input type=range min=0 max=599 value=599 step=1 aria-label=\"Calibration progress\"><span class=\"mvis-progress-label\">Loading</span></div></div>", "map": "<p>Solved positions and orientations, to scale in the IMU frame. Drag sideways to orbit. Tap a sensor for its values.</p><div class=map><div class=stage><canvas id=rig tabindex=0 aria-label=\"3D map of the cameras and IMU\"></canvas><div class=tools><button data-view=iso type=button>3D</button><button data-view=front type=button>Front</button><button data-view=top type=button>Top</button><button data-view=side type=button>Side</button><button data-z=1 type=button aria-label=\"Zoom in\">+</button><button data-z=-1 type=button aria-label=\"Zoom out\">−</button></div></div><div class=panel><div class=picks id=picks></div><div id=info></div></div></div>", "hardware": "<div class=scroll><table><thead><tr><th>Item</th><th>Value</th><th>Source</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Maker</td><td>Dongguan Hampo Electronic Technology</td><td><span class=chip>Owner</span></td></tr><tr><td>Closest published model</td><td>USB-3372-V1.0: dual 2MP global shutter, M12 fixed focus, IMU at 100, 200 or 500 Hz, SD storage. The exact model isn&#x27;t confirmed</td><td><span class=chip>Maker</span></td></tr><tr><td>Cameras</td><td>2 × 1600×1200, H.264, 30 fps, colour</td><td><span class=chip>Measured</span></td></tr><tr><td>Shutter</td><td>Not confirmed on this unit; global on the USB-3372 sheet</td><td><span class=chip>Unknown</span></td></tr><tr><td>IMU</td><td>505 Hz measured, 500 Hz set</td><td><span class=chip>Measured</span></td></tr><tr><td>Sync</td><td>Both cameras share one frame time in the recorder log</td><td><span class=chip>Measured</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=note>Maker's specs from <a href=\"https://www.hampotech.com/3372-wifi-ego-camera-module-for-egocentric-data-collection-global-shutter-stereo-6-axis-imu-sd-recording-product/\">Hampo USB-3372 product page</a>, checked 2026-11-03.</p><p class=note>Company: <a href=\"https://www.hampotech.com/\">Dongguan Hampo Electronic Technology</a>.</p>", "dataset": "<div class=two><div class=scroll><table><tbody><tr><td>Recordings</td><td>1 recording. cam0 107.8 s, 3,235 frames. cam1 stops at 57.6 s, 1,728 frames</td></tr><tr><td>Format</td><td>Unfinalised MP4s, rebuilt, then converted to EuRoC layout</td></tr><tr><td>Board</td><td>AprilGrid 8×6, tag 50 mm, spacing 0.3</td></tr><tr><td>Hosted</td><td>Not hosted</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div><svg class=board viewBox=\"-7.5 -7.5 390.0 550.0\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"AprilGrid layout to scale\"><rect x=\"0.00\" y=\"0.00\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\"/><rect x=\"65.00\" y=\"0.00\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\"/><rect x=\"130.00\" y=\"0.00\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\"/><rect x=\"195.00\" y=\"0.00\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\"/><rect x=\"260.00\" y=\"0.00\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\"/><rect x=\"325.00\" y=\"0.00\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\"/><rect x=\"0.00\" y=\"65.00\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\"/><rect x=\"65.00\" y=\"65.00\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\"/><rect x=\"130.00\" y=\"65.00\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\"/><rect x=\"195.00\" y=\"65.00\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\"/><rect x=\"260.00\" y=\"65.00\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\"/><rect x=\"325.00\" y=\"65.00\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\"/><rect x=\"0.00\" y=\"130.00\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\"/><rect x=\"65.00\" y=\"130.00\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\"/><rect x=\"130.00\" y=\"130.00\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\"/><rect x=\"195.00\" y=\"130.00\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\"/><rect x=\"260.00\" y=\"130.00\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\"/><rect x=\"325.00\" y=\"130.00\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\"/><rect x=\"0.00\" y=\"195.00\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\"/><rect x=\"65.00\" y=\"195.00\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\"/><rect x=\"130.00\" y=\"195.00\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\"/><rect x=\"195.00\" y=\"195.00\" widt